{"version":1,"key":"card:97","content":{"id":97,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"作业控制：启动、停止、终止、恢复作业。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"jobs","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 查看作业，"},{"type":"formatted","text":"Ctrl + Z","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"停止作业。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"#!/bin/zsh\n\ncount=3\nwhile [ $count -gt 0 ]\ndo\n\techo \"Hello $count.\"\n\tsleep 2\n\tcount=$[ $count - 1 ]\ndone","language":"bash","uuid":"c0d9fb5d-dfac-4479-a66b-32334f5d807b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"code-block","code":"xt in ~/shell/sig λ ./05.sh\nHello 3.\nHello 2.\n^Z\n[1]  + 1759 suspended  ./05.sh\n\nxt in ~/shell/sig λ ./05.sh > jobsout &\n[2] 1880\n\nxt in ~/shell/sig λ jobs\n[1]  + suspended  ./05.sh\n[2]  - running    ./05.sh > jobsout","language":"bash","uuid":"4c223c15-ca96-4f9a-93a6-9f38d26e1c65","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"jobs","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的加号会被当做默认作业，使用作业控制命令时，若未指定作业号，该作业就是操作对象；带减号会成为下一个默认作业。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"任何时候只有一个带加号和一个带减号的作业。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"bg + 作业号","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 以后台模式重启一个作业；"},{"type":"formatted","text":"fg + 作业号","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 以前台重启作业。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"note","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"zsh","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中，要在作业号前加上 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"%","code":true}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"fg %1","language":"Bash","uuid":"a1d25989-6410-4d00-b860-55e7d21cabb4","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}]}],"tags":["Linux/作业调度"],"